## 1. PROJECT OBJECTIVE

Improve and upgrade the existing College Portal into a modern, premium, professional, fully functional, and real-time academic management platform.

The current application already contains student and organizer dashboards, user profiles, academic timetables, fee management, faculty mentoring, leave applications, academic doubts, and approval workflows.

**Your task is to improve the existing application, not build a separate application or replace working features.**

Inspect the existing codebase, understand its architecture, identify the root causes of the reported problems, and implement complete solutions.

